<s-1 id="RM000001K0U002X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00001R100000">
<ptxt>Install Amplifier Microphone Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E147025" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Engage the 2 claws and install the amplifier microphone assembly to the interior illumination light NO,1.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E147024" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000001K0U002X_01_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___00009Z000000">
<ptxt>Install Interior Illumination Light Assembly NO.1
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect the connector.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Fix the harness to the clamp at the position shown in the illustration.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B168875" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Engage the 8 clips and install interior illumination light assembly No.1.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167258" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
